        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "In an argon-filled glovebox, [Ce(NR2)3] (R = SiMe3) was dissolved in toluene and excess H-hfip was added by pipette until the mixture stopped effervescing and became clear. The reaction was then set aside with the cap loose until crystals formed, typically within 12 h. Compounds were handled with Schlenk-line and glovebox exclusion of air and water.",
